{"total": 586, "rows": [{"createBy": null, "createTime": "2026-09-09 14:18:17", "updateBy": null, "updateTime": "2026-09-09 18:58:23", "remark": null, "gonggaoId": 16734, "orgcode": "91371625787193781K", "gonggaoTitle": "青春赴山海-匠造金佰特 金佰特2027校园招聘", "infoFrom": "2", "gonggaoContent": "<p><img src=\"https://caiji.gxjy.sdei.edu.cn/publicfile/zpgg/xq/2026/09/09/0d1389b82a44453bae0e58592129b568.jpg\" style=\"width: 574.656px;\"/><br/></p>", "validTime": "2026-11-30 00:00:00", "viewTotal": 5, "markTotal": 0, "status": "3", "createUserName": "山东金佰特商用厨具有限公司", "updateUserName": "事务组", "checkUserName": "事务组", "checkTime": "2026-09-09 18:58:23", "checkReason": null, "school": "10456", "comid": "19110", "isTop": 0, "url": null, "iswailian": 0, "wailian": null, "companyname": "山东金佰特商用厨具有限公司", "issc": "1", "schoolName": null, "schoolCodes": null}, {"createBy": null, "createTime": "2026-09-08 17:35:26", "updateBy": null, "updateTime": "2026-09-09 18:58:17", "remark": null, "gonggaoId": 16614, "orgcode": "91110105717746424A", "gonggaoTitle": "中国工商银行宁波市分行 2027年度校园招聘公告", "infoFrom": "2", "gonggaoContent": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:center;text-indent: 0pt; padding: 0pt; line-height: 29.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 方正小标宋简体; font-size: 22pt;\">中国工商银行宁波市分行</span><span style=\"font-family: 方正小标宋简体; font-size: 22pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:center;text-indent: 0pt; padding: 0pt; line-height: 29.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 方正小标宋简体; font-size: 22pt;\">2027年度校园招聘公告</span><span style=\"font-family: 方正小标宋简体; font-size: 22pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 0pt; padding: 0pt; line-height: 29.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Arial Black&quot;;\">？</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 32pt; line-height: 29.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Arial Black&quot;;\">中国工商银行宁波市分行是中国工商银行直属分行，曾荣获</span></span><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Arial Black&quot;;\">“全国五一劳动奖状”荣誉称号，是宁波市经营规模较大、服务功能齐全、经营管理先进、科技水平领先的现代商业银行。</span></span></span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 32pt; line-height: 29.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">秉持着</span><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">“工于至诚，行以致远”企业文化，工行宁波市分行坚定不移走中国特色发展金融之路，持续深化高质量发展，近年来经营发展总体稳健。截至2026年上半年，存贷款余额合计近8100亿元。存款、贷款和中间业务收入等主营指标同业领先。在自身发展壮大的同时，始终坚持以国有大行使命担当助力中国式现代化，以工行所长服务宁波地方经济社会高质量发展，为长三角一体化、打造新质生产力以及现代化滨海大都市建设等重大战略提供优质金融服务，得到市委市政府高度认可。</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 32pt; line-height: 29.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;\">工行宁波市分行始终坚持客户至上工作理念，始终将客户利益放在首位。全行</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;\">近</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;\">4000名职工、15</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;\">0余</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;\">家物</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">理网点及行业领先的</span><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">D-ICBC数字金融系统，全情服务全市超920万个人客户和超10万对公客户，获得广泛好评，先后两次获评全国“银行业营业网点文明规范服务百佳示范单位”。此外，我行还获评2024年度宁波市金融支持实体经济贡献突出20强、发展杰出贡献金融企业、社会责任先锋金融企业、优秀品牌营销金融企业、服务乡村振兴优秀金融机构、金融支持实体经济发展贡献突出机构等一系列荣誉。</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 32pt; line-height: 29.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 黑体; font-size: 16pt;\">一、招聘机构</span><span style=\"font-family: 黑体; font-size: 16pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 32pt; line-height: 29.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;\">中国工商银行</span><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;\">宁波市分行</span></span><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 32pt; line-height: 29.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 黑体; font-size: 16pt;\">二、招聘范围</span><span style=\"font-family: 黑体; font-size: 16pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 32pt; line-height: 29.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;\">面向境内、境外高校毕业生，毕业时间为</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;\">2026</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">年</span><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">1月至</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;\">2027</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">年</span><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">7月。</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 32pt; line-height: 29.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 黑体; font-size: 16pt;\">三、招聘岗位</span><span style=\"font-family: 黑体; font-size: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-family:黑体\">（</span><span style=\"font-family:黑体\">210人）</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 黑体; font-size: 16pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 10px 0pt; text-indent: 32pt; line-height: 29.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;\">（一）</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;\">星辰管培生。</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;\">主要为各级机构管理类岗位提供基础人才储备，该类岗位录用人员将优先纳入</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;\">星辰</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;\">管培生培养计划。</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 10px 0pt; text-indent: 32pt; line-height: 29.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;\">（二）</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;\">科技菁英</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;\">。立足服务本行数字化转型战略，甄选科技专业人才。主要承担产品研发、数据分析、网络安全建设、科技设备管理等职能，并运用大模型、云计算、区块链等技术实现前沿科技与银行业务的融合发展。</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 10px 0pt; text-indent: 32pt; line-height: 29.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;\">（三）</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;\">客户经理。主要为零售与对公金融营销岗位引进适用性人才。</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;\">新员工录用后原则上先安排至基层营业网点进行</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;\">一定期限的</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;\">培养锻炼</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;\">，</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;\">之后根据</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;\">个人工作表现</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;\">及工作需要等</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;\">，聘入相应岗位工作。</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 10px 0pt; text-indent: 32pt; line-height: 29.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;\">（四）</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;\">客服经理。主要在营业网点从事柜面业务处理、厅堂服务、识别推介</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;\">等工作</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;\">，</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;\">入职后应按相关要求在该岗位工作一定年限。</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 32pt; line-height: 29.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 黑体; font-size: 16pt;\">四、工作地点</span><span style=\"font-family: 黑体; font-size: 16pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 32pt; line-height: 29.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;\">浙江省宁波市</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 32pt; line-height: 29.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 黑体; font-size: 16pt;\">五、招聘条件</span><span style=\"font-family: 黑体; font-size: 16pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 32.4pt; line-height: 29.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; color: #000000; font-size: 16pt;\">1、招聘录用人员应为2027年应届毕业生。对毕业后户口、档案、组织关系仍保留在原毕业学校，或保留在各级毕业生就业主管部门(毕业生就业指导服务中心)、各级人才交流服务机构和各级公共就业服务机构，且毕业至今从未与其他单位建立劳动关系的2026年境内外高校毕业生，可以按照2027年应届毕业生对待。</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; color: #000000; font-size: 16pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 32.4pt; line-height: 29.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; color: #000000; font-size: 16pt;\">2、境内高校应届毕业生须在2027年7月31日前毕业，报到时须获得国家认可的与最高学历对应的毕业证和与最高学历对应的学位证。</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; color: #000000; font-size: 16pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 32.4pt; line-height: 29.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; color: #000000; font-size: 16pt;\">3、境外高校应届毕业生须在2026年1月1日至2027年7月31日期间毕业，报到时须获得与最高学历对应的毕业证和与最高学历对应的学位证，以及国家教育部留学服务中心出具的学历(学位)认证，并须为初次就业人员。</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; color: #000000; font-size: 16pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 32.4pt; line-height: 29.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; color: #000000; font-size: 16pt;\">4、境内高校应届毕业生的毕业时间以毕业证书落款时间为准;境外高校毕业生的毕业时间以国家教育部留学服务中心出具的学历(学位)认证上的毕业时间为准。</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; color: #000000; font-size: 16pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 29.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 黑体; font-size: 16pt;\">六、注意事项</span><span style=\"font-family: 黑体; font-size: 16pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 32.4pt; line-height: 29.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; color: #000000; font-size: 16pt;\">（一）本次招聘可通过</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; color: #000000; font-size: 16pt;\">PC端或手机移动端进行线上报名申请。</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri; color: #000000; font-size: 16pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 32pt; line-height: 29.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; color: #000000; font-size: 16pt;\">（二）</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; color: #000000; font-size: 16pt;\">招聘程序中各环节成绩对本次招聘有效。</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri; color: #000000; font-size: 16pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 32pt; line-height: 29.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; color: #000000; font-size: 16pt;\">（三）招聘期间，我行将通过招聘系统信息提示、手机短信或电子邮件等方式与应聘者联系，请保持通信畅通。</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri; color: #000000; font-size: 16pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 32pt; line-height: 29.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; color: #000000; font-size: 16pt;\">（四）应聘者应对申请资料信息的真实性负责。如与事实不符，我行有权取消其应聘资格，解除相关协议约定。</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri; color: #000000; font-size: 16pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 32pt; line-height: 29.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; color: #000000; font-size: 16pt;\">（五）我行从未成立或委托成立任何考试中心、命题中心等机构或类似机构，从未编辑或出版过任何校园招聘考试参考资料，从未向任何机构提供过校园招聘考试相关的资料和信息。</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri; color: #000000; font-size: 16pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 32pt; line-height: 29.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; color: #000000; font-size: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">（六）了解更多招聘讯息及相关动态，敬请关注</span><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">“中国工商银行人才招聘”微信公众号。</span></span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri; color: #000000; font-size: 16pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 32pt; line-height: 29.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; color: #000000; font-size: 16pt;\">（七）我行有权根据报名情况，调整、取消或终止部分岗位的招聘计划，并在法律允许的范围内对本次招聘享有最终解释权。</span><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 32.4pt; line-height: 29.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 黑体; font-size: 16pt;\">七、</span></p><table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><tbody><tr><td width=\"294.167\" height=\"0\"><br/></td></tr><tr><td><br/></td><td><br/></td></tr></tbody></table><p><span style=\"font-family: 黑体; font-size: 16pt;\">投递方式：</span><span style=\"font-family: 黑体; font-size: 16pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p><br/></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 32pt; line-height: 29.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; color: #000000; font-size: 16pt;\">&nbsp;</span><img src=\"https://caiji.gxjy.sdei.edu.cn/publicfile/zpgg/xq/2026/09/08/3f7b49d98b4b41a88ab9d750c109cae3.png\" style=\"width: 180px;\"/></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 32pt; line-height: 29.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; color: #000000; font-size: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">移动端：扫描上方二维码</span><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312\">→“校园招聘”→“筛选”→“宁波分行”</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; color: #000000; font-size: 16pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 32pt; line-height: 29.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; color: #000000; font-size: 16pt;\">PC</span><span style=\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; color: #000000; font-size: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋_GB2312